# native-keeps.pro: classes that native code (C++ and Rust: React Native, Hermes, Expo,
# WebRTC, libsignal, SQLite...) finds by name, kept whole so R8 never removes or renames
# them or anything in them. R8 can't see those uses itself.
#
# Made from the release APK: every class name written inside its .so libraries that is
# one of the app's classes (see LEARN.md, step 31). After updating a native library,
# make it again the same way. plugins/withNativeKeeps.js adds this file to R8's rules.

